{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"thermal solver residual convergence thermal solver residual convergence","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","fileName":"Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Thermal Solver Residual Convergence","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:55\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Finite Element Thermal Modeling]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Finite Element Thermal Modeling","Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"thermal solver residual convergence thermal solver residual convergence","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","fileName":"Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Thermal Solver Residual Convergence","heading":"Thermal Solver Residual Convergence","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A numerical solver substitutes an approximate field into the assembled equations and measures the remaining imbalance as a residual. Iteration continues until the residual meets a defined tolerance or another stopping condition is reached.\n\nConvergence only shows that the discretized equations were solved to the chosen criterion; it does not prove that the equations, mesh, properties, or conditions represent reality. Residual plots therefore complement, rather than replace, [[Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling|verification and validation]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Finite Element Thermal Modeling","Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"thermal solver residual convergence thermal solver residual convergence","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","fileName":"Thermal Solver Residual Convergence.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Thermal Solver Residual Convergence","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Finite Element Thermal Modeling","Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}